  "description": "A comprehensive .NET library for interacting with WhatsApp Web using browser automation. Alternative to WhatsApp Business API with full WhatsApp Web functionality. Port of the popular wajs JavaScript library to C# with modern .NET patterns, strong typing, and async/await support. Perfect for WhatsApp bots, automation, and integration.",
